{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure in a delicately hand-painted fictional world. You will control the mysterious sickle maiden, explore this fantastic and colorful mysterious city - the &quot;Invisible City&quot;, find the truth of tomorrow's flower transformation, and save the alien race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufeff</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The capital without appearance:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A city shrouded in black mist all year round, with various areas divided within, only the elite class of society can travel to and from each area by &quot;train&quot;. Ordinary residents cannot have a complete understanding of the entire city. Therefore, the public named the city they live in as the &quot;Capital of No Appearance&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to the black mist, each area of the city of no appearance has its own topography and cultural style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling and exhilarating series of battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waving the sickle symbolizing death in battle. Utilize a variety of attack derived actions and freely combine 15 different styles of skills to create refreshing combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-06-23_145852.png?t=1750754185\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/1.gif?t=1750754185\" /></div>Exquisite hand drawn art style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many exquisite hand drawn backgrounds, animations, and comics in the game. Display the visual characteristics of this game through a large number of frame by frame and grid by grid drawings.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/3487981c9b61a1428c29108194210c93.avif?t=1750754185\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exciting boss battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of exciting boss battles. Gorgeous skills to face monsters at different stages<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/2.gif?t=1750754185\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich Growth System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talent tree, skill upgrade, equipment system, pet system. Collecting materials and searching for treasures during the adventure constantly enhances players' abilities<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/e83de751f33632afdb0075582270306d.avif?t=1750754185\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3193330?t=1750754185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3193330?t=1750754185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/78b450828a7e21fb92b2f6ce26d464a2e9bdddc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750754185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/78b450828a7e21fb92b2f6ce26d464a2e9bdddc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750754185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure in a delicately hand-painted fictional world. You will control the mysterious sickle maiden, explore this fantas